<title>AUSTRALIA: SFE wheat futures near-idle as market ponders.</title>
<headline>SFE wheat futures near-idle as market ponders.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Futures Exchange wheat futures saw little action on Tuesday, with a single lot of January wheat the sole trade.</p>
<p>Bullish sentiment linked to modest upward price movement in Chicago on Monday was being countered by concerns rainfall in Australia's eastern wheat-growing regions might hurt local prices, a grains trader said.</p>
